{
  "name": "PDF Form Filler Automation",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "fill-pdf-form",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "webhook-form",
      "name": "Webhook Form Data",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [240, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "read",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": ""
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": ""
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "sheets-template",
      "name": "Read Sheets Template",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [460, 300],
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "",
          "name": ""
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const items = $input.all();\nconst formData = $('Webhook Form Data').item.json.body;\nconst templateFields = items[0]?.json || {};\nconst filledFields = {};\nfor (const [key, defaultVal] of Object.entries(templateFields)) {\n  filledFields[key] = formData[key] || defaultVal || '';\n}\nfilledFields.filledAt = new Date().toISOString();\nfilledFields.filledBy = formData.submitterName || 'System';\nreturn [{ json: { fields: filledFields, templateId: formData.templateId || 'default' } }];"
      },
      "id": "fill-fields",
      "name": "Code Fill Fields",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [680, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "https://api.pdfgeneratorapi.com/v3/documents/generate",
        "method": "POST",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ template: $json.templateId, data: $json.fields, output: 'pdf' }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 60000
        }
      },
      "id": "generate-pdf",
      "name": "HTTP Generate Filled PDF",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [900, 300],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "",
          "name": ""
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "sendTo": "={{ $('Webhook Form Data').item.json.body.recipientEmail }}",
        "subject": "=Filled Form: {{ $('Code Fill Fields').item.json.templateId }}",
        "message": "=Your filled PDF form is attached.\n\nTemplate: {{ $('Code Fill Fields').item.json.templateId }}\nFilled by: {{ $('Code Fill Fields').item.json.fields.filledBy }}\nDate: {{ $('Code Fill Fields').item.json.fields.filledAt }}",
        "options": {
          "attachmentsUi": {
            "attachmentsBinary": [{}]
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "gmail-recipient",
      "name": "Gmail to Recipient",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmail",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [1120, 300],
      "credentials": {
        "gmailOAuth2": {
          "id": "",
          "name": ""
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "append",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": ""
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": ""
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "autoMapInputData"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "sheets-log",
      "name": "Sheets Log",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [1340, 300],
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "",
          "name": ""
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## PDF Form Filler Automation\n\nReceives form data via webhook → reads template fields from Sheets →\nCode fills in field values → generates filled PDF → emails to recipient → logs to Sheets.\n\n**Setup:**\n1. Create template fields sheet (field names as headers, defaults as first row)\n2. Configure PDF generation API\n3. Set Gmail credentials\n4. POST { templateId, recipientEmail, field1, field2, ... } to webhook"
      },
      "id": "sticky-note",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [240, 80]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Webhook Form Data": {
      "main": [
        [{ "node": "Read Sheets Template", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]
      ]
    },
    "Read Sheets Template": {
      "main": [
        [{ "node": "Code Fill Fields", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]
      ]
    },
    "Code Fill Fields": {
      "main": [
        [{ "node": "HTTP Generate Filled PDF", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]
      ]
    },
    "HTTP Generate Filled PDF": {
      "main": [
        [{ "node": "Gmail to Recipient", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]
      ]
    },
    "Gmail to Recipient": {
      "main": [
        [{ "node": "Sheets Log", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]
      ]
    }
  }
}